# [SIDROPS](../wg/sidrops.html)

## Summary

The SIDROPS Working Group met at IETF 127. The session covered working group document status updates, an introduction to the RPKI Doctors review team, an update on the RPKIViews SQLite database, experimental findings on Post-Quantum Cryptography (PQC) in RPKI, analysis against mixing certificate chains, and proposals regarding BGP Signed Origin Delegation Attestation (SODA) and information asymmetry in Route Origin Validation (ROV).

